              "text": "[Document context]\nTitle: Issue #15208 histogram candidate note\nSource: Sana Farid candidate review\nPath: /artifacts/issue-15208-histogram-candidate.md\nWorkspace: person/sana-farid/issue-15208-histogram\n\n# Issue #15208 histogram candidate\n\nBins use raw minimum, maximum, and score magnitudes; only labels are rounded to three decimals. Regressions cover the `0.857` boundary, distinct narrow-range labels, and count preservation. This matches the issue contract and dashboard precision requirement. Targeted Vitest remains to run in a bootstrapped checkout because this mount has no Node/pnpm toolchain.",
