# Issue #15208 weighted-aggregation candidate

`avg_<base>` and `average_<base>` totals use `count_<base>` weights when every contributing average has a count and the total weight is positive; otherwise behavior falls back to the prior arithmetic mean. Regressions cover unequal group sizes, both average prefixes, and the no-count fallback. Targeted Vitest remains to run in a bootstrapped checkout because this mount has no Node/pnpm toolchain.","content_hash":"8f34c9ea48965773c3a8935db7528cc41e8c9656739c80966213be4c9777321a","chunk_metadata":{"ordinal":0,"document_path":"/artifacts/issue-15208-weighted-candidate.md","document_kind":"curated","workspace":"person/sana-farid/issue-15208-weighted","team":""}}},"conflict_id":null,"change_id":"qdrant:4804380a7abd141b91c0a676"}],"conflicts":[],"resolution":{"conflict_choices":{}}},"filesystem":{"source":"person/sana-farid/issue-15208-weighted","target":"person/sana-farid","changes":[{"table":"chronosfs_dirent","key":{"path":"/artifacts/issue-15208-weighted-candidate.md"},"change":"added","before":null,"after":{"path":"/artifacts/issue-15208-weighted-candidate.md","present":true},"conflict_id":null,"change_id":"filesystem:8f0d23daa1f8c64176cfc375"},{"table":"chronosfs_file_range","key":{"path":"/code/langfuse/web/src/__tests__/server/pivot-table-utils.servertest.ts","byte_range":{"start":12288,"end":16384}},"change":"modified","before":{"path":"/code/langfuse/web/src/__tests__/server/pivot-table-utils.servertest.ts","byte_range":{"start":12288,"end":16384},"byte_length":4096,"sha256":"8da14f5ab4f5f32a1e03fc08823cfc1e38577076d0e91dc6959cf728a0cf5007","content_encoding":"utf-8","content":"ues: grandTotalValues,
